title: Daniel_LoadPhase
---
//<<declare $totalMaxwellsDaniel = 0>>
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Daniel = "">>
<<checkMaxwells GameController>>
//<<setMaxwells Daniel>>
//<<if $totalMaxwellsDaniel >= 10>>
//<<getPhase Daniel "questCompleted">>
//<<endif>>
<<setPhase Daniel>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Daniel == "begin">>
<<jump Daniel_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Daniel == "comeback" >>
<<jump Daniel_Comeback01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Daniel == "questStarted">>
<<jump Daniel_QuestStarted01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Daniel == "questCompleted">>
<<jump Daniel_QuestCompleted01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Daniel == "rewardGiven">>
<<jump Daniel_RewardGiven01>>
<<else>>
Daniel: Stop breaking my game!
<<endif>>
===
title: Daniel_Begin01
---
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: Hello, stranger!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: Hi!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: I'm Daniel!
Daniel: You're new here, aren't you?
Daniel: I should know, there's only 10 other people in this world!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: Why, yes I am!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: You probably want to know what it is I do then, don't you?
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
->Yes
    You: Why yes! What do you do here, Daniel?
    <<jump Daniel_Begin02>>
->No
    <<jump DanielBegin03>>
===
title: Daniel_Begin02
---
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: I harvest Maxwells!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: ...I'm sorry, did you say Maxwells?
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: Yes! Cute little things, they are.
Daniel: I'm guessing from your robotic expression that you've never heard of them before.
Daniel: Maxwells are these small cats that like to hang out around this here world!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: And you.... collect them?
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: Yes!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: ...Why?
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: So anyway, if you collect 10 Maxwells and bring them to me, something great is bound to happen!
Daniel: You can find Maxwells around the world, or from other people!
Daniel: Good Luck!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: ...ok man.
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Daniel "questStarted">>
===
title: DanielBegin03
---
You: Eh, I kinda don't care.
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: ...oh.
Daniel: Well... I didn't want to tell you anyways!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: Cool!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Daniel "comeback">>
===
title: Daniel_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: Aha! You're back! You do care after all!
Daniel: So, ready to hear about what it is I do??
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
-> Yes
    You: God, fine I guess. Tell me.
    <<jump Daniel_Begin02>>
-> No
    You: No... you're really freaking me out actually.
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "return">>
===
title: Daniel_QuestStarted01
---
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: Ah, you're back!
Daniel: There's still some Maxwells out there, so keep looking!
Daniel: Remember there are 10 Maxwells total! Happy hunting!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: ...Right.
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "return">>
===
title: Daniel_QuestCompleted01
---
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: Ah, look here! You found all the Maxwells!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: Yeah!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: You know what that means!!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: No! What??
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: ....
Daniel: .....i actually don't know
Daniel: you're the first one to ever do this :/
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: ...ah.
You: Do I get some kind of reward or something?
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: Oh yes! Of course!
Daniel: Although.... I don't really have much to give.
Daniel: Oh I know! Let's have a party! I'll invite all the 12 people you know!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "pc">>
You: Aw sweet!!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Daniel "rewardGiven">>
===
title: Daniel_RewardGiven01
---
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "npc">>
Daniel: You aren't actually supposed to see this text!
<<camMove Daniel_CamRig "return">>
===